---
import ContentLayout from '@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout section="legal" title="Accessibility" heading="Accessibility statement" updated="5 October 2026">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to shop CharFlut. We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 level AA.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every page works with a keyboard, with a visible yellow focus outline.</li>
    <li>If your device is set to reduce motion, smooth scrolling, parallax and 3D animation switch off.</li>
    <li>Every 3D product view has a normal photo gallery next to it.</li>
    <li>Text meets contrast guidelines, and body text is at least 16px.</li>
    <li>Checkout has no animation and shows clear errors next to each field.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Known issues</h2>
  <p>The 3D viewer cannot be fully described to screen readers; the photo gallery and written details cover the same information.</p>
  <h2>Tell us</h2>
  <p>If something is hard to use, email accessibility@charflut.com and we will help you order and fix the problem.</p>
</ContentLayout>
